  "notable_quotes": [
    "MAC-17 is porous in theory with an accessible surface area of about 1427.54 m2 g−1, but experimental adsorption could not be measured because H3O+ and water block the channels.",
    "Prior flexible MOFs are limited to switch-on adsorption of only a single substance, so stepwise-controlled adsorption of mixed substances remains challenging.",
    "Precise regulation of hinge angle and hydrogen-bond interactions enables MAC-20 to undergo a unique two-step pore-shape change via synergy between the 1D chain and tritopic ligand."
